To demonstrate, let's execute again `module list` to show which modules we 
currently have loaded in our environment among Python3.

```
{{ site.remote.prompt }} module list
```
{: .language-bash}

```
Currently Loaded Modules:
  1) zlib/1.2.11-gcc-9.4.0              8) ncurses/6.2-gcc-9.4.0       15) gettext/0.21-gcc-9.4.0
  2) xz/5.2.5-gcc-9.4.0                 9) libxml2/2.9.12-gcc-9.4.0    16) gdbm/1.21-gcc-9.4.0
  3) util-linux-uuid/2.36.2-gcc-9.4.0  10) libxcrypt/4.4.33-gcc-9.4.0  17) expat/2.4.1-gcc-9.4.0
