  5) sqlite/3.36.0-gcc-9.4.0           12) libiconv/1.16-gcc-9.4.0     19) python/3.10.10-gcc-9.4.0
  6) readline/8.1-gcc-9.4.0            13) libffi/3.3-gcc-9.4.0
  7) openssl/1.1.1l-gcc-9.4.0          14) libbsd/0.11.3-gcc-9.4.0

```
{: .output}

This shows that by loading the `python` module multiple modules where loaded too.
They are dependencies required by the `python` module. We can check the dependencies 
without loading a module by executing `module show`.

```
{{ site.remote.prompt }} module show python
```
{: .language-bash}

```
